Subject: Matching Coordinate System for Global and Coverage Layers
Message-ID: <923yHYUUR7k.JYycTEMuDAAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/923yHYUUR7k/m/JYycTEMuDAAJ>
